  "notes": {
    "n1": {
      "fill": "orange",
      "text": "Backgrounds are the real 0.1.4 shots (game/reports/ui-compare/spin-c, the spin-r1 pick), untouched. Only the new UI is drawn on top. Each phone is 360×640 = half of 720×1280, so a 60 px icon here is the 120 px target of V11.",
      "w": 340,
      "x": 2200,
      "y": 0
    },
    "n2": {
      "fill": "blue",
      "text": "No navigation bar: round icons float over the farm, in the free sky and edges, clear of the top info and the Harvest/Spin/Sell anchors (V13). Icons may overlap props. Zooms hide the rail: Back is the only exit, as approved in 0.1.4.",
      "w": 340,
      "x": 2200,
      "y": 420
    },
    "n3": {
      "fill": "green",
      "page": "page-slot",
      "text": "Bottom slot is decided by play-test (designer, 2026-11-09). A = today's quick-buy panel kept, plus the Shop icon (board 1 on the Farm & harvest page). B, C, D replace the panel; the Shop icon stays in all four.",
